Thanks for playing! Here's this week's fix list:

“Go around” aircraft now get removed;
Code changes to reduce likelihood of empty aprons;
Increased traffic rate during challenges;
Added “planes moved” after challenges completed;
Tightened immediate takeoff turns;
Fixed certain congested locations at runway thresholds.

Made challenges more achievable;
Made changes to reduce/eliminate issues with stuck aircraft; 
Fixed London slow backtrack issue.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/31284389/be14215763a68a7726048b863936daa03761073d.jpg[/img]

